":"I see that you've raised the guidance for 2021 to mine 4,650 tonnes rather than the 4,500 tonnes run rate that you were previously assuming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/hudbay-minerals-inc-hbm-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"HBM 2021 Q1","e":"hbm","d":"2021-05-12","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Lawson Winder","x":"I mean, you mentioned -- of course, you reiterated the guidance, you reaffirmed that and you're confident in meeting that, but I did note that you called out $4.6 million in Q1 of additional costs that I think were unexpected related to COVID.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/hudbay-minerals-inc-hbm-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"HBM 2021 Q3","e":"hbm","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Gerald Jan Kukielski","x":"Third quarter adjusted net earnings were $38 million or $0.15 per share after normalizing for an impairment due to an updated Flin Flon closure plan and Flin Flon restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/hudbay-minerals-inc-hbm-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"HBM 2025 Q2","e":"hbm","d":"2025-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Peter Kukielski","x":"…to develop our world-class Copper World project and establish a long-term strategic partnership that will unlock significant value in our copper growth pipeline through a highly accretive joint venture, an enhanced precious metal streaming deal, and the achievement of our financial targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/hudbay-hbm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HBM 2025 Q2","e":"hbm","d":"2025-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Dalton Baretto","x":"But on the flip side, right, there's a lack of smelting capacity in the U.S. A potential tariff could come in on concentrate export.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/hudbay-hbm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HBM 2025 Q2","e":"hbm","d":"2025-08-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andre Lauzon","x":"And so the fire situation is actually getting much, much better, and they've been getting rain and the fires passed through town.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/hudbay-hbm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HBM 2025 Q2","e":"hbm","d":"2025-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Kukielski","x":"The Lalor mine managed through a period of reduced workforce prior to and after the temporary suspension of operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/hudbay-hbm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HBM 2025 Q4","e":"hbm","d":"2026-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Peter Kukielski","x":"There have been some tariffs introduced on key equipment that might be procured from outside the country.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/20/hudbay-hbm-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HBM 2026 Q1","e":"hbm","d":"2026-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Gerald Kukielski","x":"Total ore mined was lower than the prior quarter because of lower effective utilization of equipment due to reduced workforce availability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/hudbay-hbm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[30,1,8103,0,0,0,5703,1461],[37,1,8430,0,0,0,86,7466],[39,1,4654,0,0,0,3967,413],[40,1,7508,0,0,0,5715,1351],[41,1,9629,0,0,0,7339,1847],[42,1,10797,0,0,0,8671,1683],[43,1,5299,0,0,0,4416,619],[44,1,8533,0,0,0,6869,1291],[45,1,6152,0,0,0,4987,878],[46,1,7561,0,0,0,5995,1229],[47,1,9492,0,0,0,7907,1201],[62,1,6553,0,0,0,5297,940],[64,1,10108,0,0,0,9080,691],[65,1,7334,0,0,0,6124,898],[67,1,9377,0,0,0,7567,1486]],"cinema":[[30,1,8103,0,0,0,5703,1461],[37,1,8430,0,0,0,86,7466],[39,1,4654,0,0,0,3967,413],[40,1,7508,0,0,0,5715,1351],[41,1,9629,0,0,0,7339,1847],[42,1,10797,0,0,0,8671,1683],[43,1